  "model_id": "hf_v13_tree_vs_foundation_target_aware_lgbm_native_quant_tradefloor_v40_10_20260512",
  "design": "Baseline HGB tree versus target-aware projection LightGBM full parent. Baseline uses the original fixed HGB parent settings. The challenger removes KAN, projects Chronos-2 and Kairos_23m embeddings with train-only PLSRegression against action/quality-derived targets, appends those target-aware factors to a residual raw feature set, and trains all parent heads with LightGBM on that feature space. V40.10 keeps V40.9's LightGBM-native missing handling and quant controls, then adds a validation trade floor to avoid selecting extremely sparse low-MDD candidates. Projection spec and full-parent LightGBM hyperparameters are selected on 2025 Q4 validation.",
